Really good game, frustating at times but still incredibly good. It's quite addicting too.
Pros:
- The gameplay is really interesting and it's great to see how you can learn from failing over and over and over again;
- The soundtrack is really good, fits really well with the game;
- Likeable characters; not gonna lie, when I first played it, I thought I wouldn't care about the story and the characters but they're actually really interesting and it makes you wonder what happened.
Cons:
- It's frustating at times, like very frustating;
- There are some levels where the colors keep changing really fast and that can give headaches if you're stuck for a long time.
Overall note: 9/10

